      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `stream_chunks.py` that streams audio chunks from an async source, I will use the AWS Transcribe service as the concrete external provider. This choice is based on its capability to handle streaming audio and its widespread use in similar applications. The code will import the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and will include specific AWS Transcribe client configurations to make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
